  "Classification targets": "Klassifikationsziele", "MRI research workflow": "MRT-Forschungsworkflow", "Enlarge VGG16 architecture diagram": "VGG16-Architekturdiagramm vergrößern", "VGG16 transfer learning architecture used for MRI classification across four classes": "VGG16-Transfer-Learning-Architektur zur MRT-Klassifikation in vier Klassen",
